WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.734
Who's to blame?

00:00:00.734 --> 00:00:01.534
An exiled former

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:02.235
Russian lawmaker

00:00:02.235 --> 00:00:03.269
linked with militant groups

00:00:03.269 --> 00:00:04.170
in Russia tells CNN

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:04.771
that he does

00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:05.372
not think it is

00:00:05.372 --> 00:00:07.841
Ukraine and said it is Russian Partizans

00:00:08.208 --> 00:00:09.776
whom he believes are behind the alleged

00:00:09.776 --> 00:00:11.277
drone attack over the Kremlin.

00:00:11.277 --> 00:00:12.779
Overnight video reviewed

00:00:12.779 --> 00:00:13.346
by CNN

00:00:13.346 --> 00:00:14.414
seems to show drones

00:00:14.414 --> 00:00:15.482
flying over the heavily

00:00:15.482 --> 00:00:16.182
fortified building

00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:17.884
in Russia's capital of Moscow.

00:00:17.884 --> 00:00:19.019
Russian officials

00:00:19.019 --> 00:00:19.853
claim Ukraine

00:00:19.853 --> 00:00:21.354
was trying to assassinate President

00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:22.489
Vladimir Putin,

00:00:22.489 --> 00:00:22.789
though

00:00:22.789 --> 00:00:23.857
Putin, of course, was

00:00:23.857 --> 00:00:25.892
not there at the time.

00:00:25.892 --> 00:00:27.360
And Ukraine strongly denies

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:28.261
any involvement.

00:00:28.261 --> 00:00:30.330
And there doesn't seem to be any evidence

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:31.564
Ukraine was involved.

00:00:31.564 --> 00:00:32.032
Nick Paton

00:00:32.032 --> 00:00:33.066
Walsh is in Ukraine

00:00:33.066 --> 00:00:34.567
tonight where the brutal war rages on

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:36.336
and at least 21

00:00:36.336 --> 00:00:37.670
people, 21

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:39.572
people were killed in the latest round

00:00:39.572 --> 00:00:40.573
of Russian attacks.

00:00:42.308 --> 00:00:42.609
It's on

00:00:42.609 --> 00:00:44.144
the edges of imagination,

00:00:44.144 --> 00:00:46.579
but the Kremlin insists it's real.

00:00:46.579 --> 00:00:48.882
An apparent drone flies into the Kremlin

00:00:49.449 --> 00:00:50.283
and detonate

00:00:50.283 --> 00:00:51.718
right on its dome,

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:53.553
captured on many cameras.

00:00:53.553 --> 00:00:55.989
A truly seismic allegation.

00:00:55.989 --> 00:00:57.590
Russia saying Ukraine

00:00:57.590 --> 00:00:59.626
sent two drones to kill President

00:00:59.626 --> 00:01:00.794
Vladimir Putin,

00:01:00.794 --> 00:01:03.263
but he wasn't home as the smoke rose.

00:01:03.496 --> 00:01:05.432
These videos played out globally.

00:01:05.432 --> 00:01:06.332
Unverified.

00:01:06.332 --> 00:01:07.667
And the only slim

00:01:07.667 --> 00:01:11.071
evidence of the Kremlin's claim

00:01:11.571 --> 00:01:13.573
it is a moment that carries great risk

00:01:13.573 --> 00:01:14.441
for the Kremlin

00:01:14.441 --> 00:01:16.576
ahead of an annual Victory Day parade

00:01:16.576 --> 00:01:19.112
there just next week. It's embarrassing.

00:01:19.312 --> 00:01:20.313
They have claimed such

00:01:20.313 --> 00:01:22.482
a breach of security happened

00:01:22.482 --> 00:01:23.550
and there will be calls

00:01:23.550 --> 00:01:24.884
for their battered military

00:01:24.884 --> 00:01:26.553
to find a way to escalate.

00:01:26.553 --> 00:01:28.388
Now they have Ukrainian

00:01:28.388 --> 00:01:29.422
President Zelensky

00:01:29.422 --> 00:01:31.257
on a visit to Finland today

00:01:31.257 --> 00:01:32.792
issued a flat denial.

00:01:32.792 --> 00:01:34.494
We don't attack

00:01:35.495 --> 00:01:39.065
Putin or Moscow.

00:01:39.065 --> 00:01:42.035
We fly too on on our territory.

00:01:42.035 --> 00:01:44.104
And we are defending our villages

00:01:44.104 --> 00:01:45.338
and cities.

00:01:45.338 --> 00:01:46.773
We don't have,

00:01:46.773 --> 00:01:49.075
you know, enough weapons for these.

00:01:49.676 --> 00:01:51.978
The US also not convinced

00:01:51.978 --> 00:01:53.313
I would take anything

00:01:53.313 --> 00:01:54.314
coming out of the Kremlin

00:01:54.314 --> 00:01:56.983
with a very large shaker of salt.

00:01:56.983 --> 00:01:58.952
But fear of Russian reprisals

00:01:58.952 --> 00:02:00.787
rising again in Ukraine,

00:02:00.787 --> 00:02:02.021
where bombings already

00:02:02.021 --> 00:02:04.991
definitely do happen every day and night.

00:02:05.492 --> 00:02:06.526
Over a dozen dead

00:02:06.526 --> 00:02:09.028
this day in a recently liberated house on

00:02:09.863 --> 00:02:11.531
a railway station shelled

00:02:11.531 --> 00:02:14.100
and a supermarket midmorning.

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:15.468
Tension mounting here

00:02:15.468 --> 00:02:16.603
ahead of an expected

00:02:16.603 --> 00:02:18.304
Ukrainian counteroffensive.

00:02:18.304 --> 00:02:19.772
So from Friday,

00:02:19.772 --> 00:02:21.608
there is a 58 hour curfew.

00:02:21.608 --> 00:02:23.710
Nobody coming out of their homes

00:02:23.710 --> 00:02:24.811
in that area

00:02:24.811 --> 00:02:27.480
on night was shaken by sirens and blasts

00:02:31.985 --> 00:02:34.487
Here is where they hit homes.

00:02:34.854 --> 00:02:37.190
The first missile landing outside

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:37.590
and leaving

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:38.191
enough time

00:02:38.191 --> 00:02:40.393
for families to jump into the bath

00:02:40.393 --> 00:02:41.928
or shelter their children

00:02:41.928 --> 00:02:43.763
before the second left this hole.

00:02:45.732 --> 00:02:46.766
But over

00:02:46.766 --> 00:02:47.467
at the process,

00:02:47.467 --> 00:02:47.834
you know,

00:02:47.834 --> 00:02:50.003
we were in such stress, Lyudmila says.

00:02:50.403 --> 00:02:52.205
But it was only when people asked us

00:02:52.205 --> 00:02:53.439
if we were okay

00:02:53.439 --> 00:02:56.342
that we realized we were alive.

00:02:56.342 --> 00:02:57.644
Like in the Kremlin.

00:02:57.644 --> 00:03:00.146
Nobody killed or injured here either,

00:03:00.613 --> 00:03:01.948
but lives destroyed

00:03:01.948 --> 00:03:05.485
and no doubt who was behind it

00:03:06.753 --> 00:03:07.253
Now, Jake,

00:03:07.253 --> 00:03:08.855
there are two ways of looking at this.

00:03:08.855 --> 00:03:11.224
One, this is an extraordinary lapse

00:03:11.224 --> 00:03:12.025
of security

00:03:12.025 --> 00:03:13.259
around the Kremlin,

00:03:13.259 --> 00:03:15.061
one that is deeply embarrassing

00:03:15.061 --> 00:03:17.297
to Vladimir Putin himself and suggests

00:03:17.297 --> 00:03:19.165
that his grip on that tight

00:03:19.165 --> 00:03:21.501
security apparatus around him

00:03:21.501 --> 00:03:22.268
and around

00:03:22.268 --> 00:03:24.871
Russia may be slipping or eroding

00:03:25.071 --> 00:03:25.972
And the second is that

00:03:25.972 --> 00:03:27.407
this is an elaborate

00:03:27.407 --> 00:03:29.042
and we've seen it before complex,

00:03:29.042 --> 00:03:30.210
what you call a false flag

00:03:30.210 --> 00:03:31.878
operation designed

00:03:31.878 --> 00:03:32.679
by Russia

00:03:32.679 --> 00:03:33.846
to potentially

00:03:33.846 --> 00:03:34.881
falsely provide

00:03:34.881 --> 00:03:36.683
a pretext for something else.

00:03:36.683 --> 00:03:38.117
That is what people are most concerned

00:03:38.117 --> 00:03:39.319
about here in Ukraine.

00:03:39.319 --> 00:03:39.919
They've seen this

00:03:39.919 --> 00:03:41.821
in Russia's history in the past.

00:03:41.821 --> 00:03:43.356
They claim they've been attacked

00:03:43.356 --> 00:03:45.058
in a new unprecedented way,

00:03:45.058 --> 00:03:45.959
and they use that

00:03:45.959 --> 00:03:48.027
to justify some new horror.

00:03:48.027 --> 00:03:48.995
Now, many look to

00:03:48.995 --> 00:03:51.197
what's not been used so far in Russia's

00:03:51.197 --> 00:03:52.699
conventional arsenal.

00:03:52.699 --> 00:03:56.269
Not too much, possibly larger bombers

00:03:56.502 --> 00:03:58.371
and also Russia's nuclear weapons.

00:03:58.371 --> 00:03:59.839
Deep fears about that.

00:03:59.839 --> 00:04:01.474
Nothing material at this stage.

00:04:01.474 --> 00:04:03.276
But Ukraine really concerned

00:04:03.276 --> 00:04:05.511
as to where this leads Jake.

00:04:05.511 --> 00:04:07.880
Nick Paton Walsh in Ukraine for us,

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:08.548
thank you so much.

00:04:08.548 --> 00:04:09.415
Joining us to discuss,

00:04:09.415 --> 00:04:10.950
the former secretary of defense

00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:11.317
and former

00:04:11.317 --> 00:04:12.552
CIA director and president

00:04:12.552 --> 00:04:13.119
under President

00:04:13.119 --> 00:04:15.188
Obama, Leon Panetta, Secretary Panetta,

00:04:15.188 --> 00:04:16.522
Sources tell CNN that U.S.

00:04:16.522 --> 00:04:16.923
officials

00:04:16.923 --> 00:04:18.758
had no warning

00:04:18.758 --> 00:04:20.760
that an attack like this was coming

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:21.694
and that the Ukrainians

00:04:21.694 --> 00:04:22.729
assured them privately

00:04:22.729 --> 00:04:24.364
they had nothing to do with it.

00:04:24.364 --> 00:04:25.031
What's your take

00:04:28.835 --> 00:04:30.603
Jake, this

00:04:30.603 --> 00:04:31.404
this really does

00:04:31.404 --> 00:04:33.573
smell like a false flag

00:04:33.573 --> 00:04:35.608
operation on the part of the Russians.

00:04:35.775 --> 00:04:37.810
A diversion if you will.

00:04:37.810 --> 00:04:40.446
And if somebody was really trying

00:04:40.446 --> 00:04:42.081
to make an effort

00:04:42.081 --> 00:04:44.584
at an assassination attempt,

00:04:44.584 --> 00:04:46.152
it was pretty far fetched.

00:04:46.152 --> 00:04:48.254
I've been to the Kremlin.

00:04:48.254 --> 00:04:50.123
The Kremlin is a fortress.

00:04:50.123 --> 00:04:50.423
Well,

00:04:50.423 --> 00:04:52.625
and Putin doesn't exactly take walks

00:04:53.192 --> 00:04:54.160
around the Kremlin.

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:56.562
There's no Rose Garden at the Kremlin.

00:04:56.562 --> 00:04:59.832
So this is this is clearly

00:05:00.566 --> 00:05:03.603
an allegation that is false.

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:05.471
I don't think there's a lot of truth

00:05:05.471 --> 00:05:06.139
to it.

00:05:06.139 --> 00:05:07.006
And at most,

00:05:07.006 --> 00:05:08.041
it probably

00:05:08.041 --> 00:05:10.076
is one of these diversionary things

00:05:10.076 --> 00:05:11.077
that kind of marks

00:05:11.077 --> 00:05:13.980
the beginning of the spring offensives

00:05:13.980 --> 00:05:15.515
that we're going to see pretty soon.

00:05:15.515 --> 00:05:16.149
So, yeah,

00:05:16.149 --> 00:05:17.450
that was going to be my next question.

00:05:17.450 --> 00:05:19.285
If this is indeed a false flag.

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:22.789
Is this do you think

00:05:22.789 --> 00:05:26.059
Russia trying to create

00:05:26.059 --> 00:05:28.561
some sort of justification for further

00:05:29.729 --> 00:05:31.864
nihilistic barbarism?

00:05:32.198 --> 00:05:33.533
Not that they need it, really.

00:05:33.533 --> 00:05:34.434
I mean, they've been doing it

00:05:34.434 --> 00:05:36.936
now for more than a year anyway.

00:05:37.637 --> 00:05:38.171
Yeah, I know.

00:05:38.171 --> 00:05:42.308
But, you know, it clearly follows the the

00:05:42.775 --> 00:05:44.911
the Putin playbook here, which is

00:05:45.578 --> 00:05:49.315
to create these kinds of false diversions

00:05:49.615 --> 00:05:51.551
in order to justify

00:05:51.551 --> 00:05:52.885
some kind of action

00:05:52.885 --> 00:05:54.787
that they're going to take.

00:05:54.821 --> 00:05:56.656
I don't know what that action would be.

00:05:56.656 --> 00:05:57.990
They're sending a lot of drones

00:05:57.990 --> 00:05:58.858
over Ukraine.

00:05:58.858 --> 00:06:00.026
They're sending a lot of

00:06:00.026 --> 00:06:02.161
missiles over the Ukraine.

00:06:02.161 --> 00:06:04.230
I don't know what additionally

00:06:06.232 --> 00:06:08.401
the Russians could do at this point,

00:06:08.401 --> 00:06:10.937
but that they're not doing now.

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:13.706
But having said that,

00:06:13.706 --> 00:06:16.008
I think that the Ukrainians probably

00:06:16.376 --> 00:06:17.310
are engaging

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:20.747
in some diversions themselves in Ukraine

00:06:21.447 --> 00:06:24.250
to try to make sure that the Russians

00:06:24.250 --> 00:06:25.118
don't quite know

00:06:25.118 --> 00:06:25.651
where they're going

00:06:25.651 --> 00:06:28.287
to show up in terms of their offensive.

00:06:28.287 --> 00:06:30.156
And I'm sure the Russians are now doing

00:06:30.156 --> 00:06:30.890
the same.

00:06:30.890 --> 00:06:34.694
We're going to see a lot of that as we as

00:06:34.694 --> 00:06:36.963
we work up to what I think

00:06:36.963 --> 00:06:38.731
is, without question,

00:06:38.731 --> 00:06:41.200
going to be a spring offensive,

00:06:41.200 --> 00:06:43.002
certainly by the Ukrainians

00:06:43.002 --> 00:06:44.971
and possibly by the Russians as well.

00:06:44.971 --> 00:06:46.873
So Russian state media claims

00:06:46.873 --> 00:06:47.840
that this drone was a

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:49.108
Ukrainian made drone

00:06:49.108 --> 00:06:51.911
called a huge 22 attack drone

00:06:52.311 --> 00:06:53.179
that theoretically

00:06:53.179 --> 00:06:54.380
would have had to have flown

00:06:54.380 --> 00:06:57.216
more than 300 miles to get to Moscow.

00:06:57.283 --> 00:06:58.017
That's just from the

00:06:58.017 --> 00:06:59.452
nearest Ukrainian border.

00:07:00.686 --> 00:07:01.654
Would a drone like

00:07:01.654 --> 00:07:02.155
that even

00:07:02.155 --> 00:07:04.957
have the capacity to inflict major damage

00:07:05.425 --> 00:07:06.259
on a building

00:07:06.259 --> 00:07:08.528
so heavily fortified as the Kremlin

00:07:11.431 --> 00:07:13.533
Well, yeah, Jake,

00:07:14.534 --> 00:07:17.637
I've I've headed up drone operations

00:07:18.404 --> 00:07:21.140
when I was a CIA director

00:07:21.140 --> 00:07:23.342
If you're serious about using a drone,

00:07:24.310 --> 00:07:25.511
the way you have to do it

00:07:25.511 --> 00:07:26.913
is to frankly conduct

00:07:26.913 --> 00:07:29.048
a great deal of surveillance

00:07:29.048 --> 00:07:31.684
in order to make sure that you know,

00:07:31.751 --> 00:07:32.051
that you're

00:07:32.051 --> 00:07:34.687
going to hit the right target.

00:07:34.787 --> 00:07:36.656
As far as I can see here, there wasn't

00:07:36.656 --> 00:07:39.325
any kind of surveillance involved

00:07:39.859 --> 00:07:41.227
There were just a couple of drones

00:07:41.227 --> 00:07:42.829
that were up in the air.

00:07:42.829 --> 00:07:44.530
So it doesn't strike me

00:07:44.530 --> 00:07:48.067
that this was a serious effort

00:07:48.067 --> 00:07:50.269
at certainly at an assassination,

00:07:50.269 --> 00:07:51.871
which is far fetched.

00:07:51.871 --> 00:07:53.906
Was it an operation to try to

00:07:54.440 --> 00:07:55.842
create some kind of damage

00:07:55.842 --> 00:07:57.810
at the Kremlin? Who knows?

00:07:59.579 --> 00:08:01.080
I think it really smells

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:02.715
like the Russians

00:08:02.715 --> 00:08:04.050
trying to set this up

00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:07.086
as some kind of diversion

00:08:07.620 --> 00:08:10.022
There just isn't a logical explanation

00:08:10.323 --> 00:08:12.191
to try to use drones

00:08:12.191 --> 00:08:13.359
to try to assassinate

00:08:13.359 --> 00:08:14.861
Putin in the Kremlin.

00:08:14.861 --> 00:08:16.095
That's just unbelievable.

00:08:16.095 --> 00:08:17.096
Well, it's also just

00:08:17.096 --> 00:08:17.363
I mean,

00:08:17.363 --> 00:08:18.197
anyone who knows

00:08:18.197 --> 00:08:20.366
anything about Putin knows.

00:08:21.300 --> 00:08:22.969
Well, first of all, I mean, we

00:08:22.969 --> 00:08:24.270
Ukrainians are fighting a war.

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:25.304
They're defending themselves.

00:08:25.304 --> 00:08:26.205
Nobody

00:08:26.973 --> 00:08:28.241
should think that they wouldn't

00:08:28.241 --> 00:08:30.443
grab an opportunity

00:08:30.443 --> 00:08:30.943
to inflict

00:08:30.943 --> 00:08:33.713
harm on them in killing their children

00:08:34.347 --> 00:08:34.881
if they could.

00:08:34.881 --> 00:08:36.716
But the idea that they would send

00:08:36.716 --> 00:08:39.552
a little drone to attack the outside

00:08:39.552 --> 00:08:40.319
of the Kremlin

00:08:40.319 --> 00:08:43.222
as a way to get Putin, when

00:08:43.222 --> 00:08:43.890
I know

00:08:43.890 --> 00:08:44.624
and I'm certainly not

00:08:44.624 --> 00:08:45.791
Ukrainian intelligence,

00:08:45.791 --> 00:08:47.293
I know that Putin's not spending

00:08:47.293 --> 00:08:48.361
the night in the Kremlin.

00:08:50.263 --> 00:08:51.464
No, that's

00:08:51.464 --> 00:08:51.797
you know,

00:08:51.797 --> 00:08:53.866
if anything, Putin just goes there

00:08:53.866 --> 00:08:55.835
for ceremonial activities.

00:08:55.835 --> 00:08:58.137
The place is well fortified.

00:08:58.137 --> 00:09:00.306
Putin is right.

00:09:00.306 --> 00:09:01.974
There's a tremendous amount of security

00:09:01.974 --> 00:09:04.343
around him at that place.

00:09:04.343 --> 00:09:05.912
If you're if you're even going to think

00:09:05.912 --> 00:09:08.347
about a possible assassination,

00:09:08.347 --> 00:09:09.549
you would look

00:09:09.615 --> 00:09:12.151
at probably at his residences

00:09:12.585 --> 00:09:17.623
outside of Moscow and near the lake.

00:09:17.990 --> 00:09:19.992
He's got a residence as well.

00:09:19.992 --> 00:09:20.726
But again,

00:09:20.726 --> 00:09:22.962
you'd have to do some surveillance

00:09:22.962 --> 00:09:24.964
to make sure that you've got a target

00:09:24.997 --> 00:09:27.767
Otherwise, you know, just wasting time

00:09:27.900 --> 00:09:31.103
and not really doing anything

00:09:31.103 --> 00:09:32.305
that's going to be effective.

00:09:32.305 --> 00:09:33.706
So I.

00:09:33.706 --> 00:09:36.876
I just see this as there's

00:09:36.876 --> 00:09:38.978
a lot of baloney that the Russians

00:09:38.978 --> 00:09:40.713
are throwing out there

00:09:40.713 --> 00:09:43.716
in order to kind of justify

00:09:44.450 --> 00:09:45.918
any further action

00:09:45.918 --> 00:09:46.385
that they're going

00:09:46.385 --> 00:09:47.853
to take against Ukraine.

00:09:47.853 --> 00:09:49.021
Former CIA Director

00:09:49.021 --> 00:09:49.855
and Secretary of Defense

00:09:49.855 --> 00:09:50.856
Leon Panetta, always good to see

00:09:50.856 --> 00:09:51.891
you, sir. Thank you so much.

00:09:53.059 --> 00:09:53.960
Good to be with you, Jack.

